==Strategy==
Bring [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]] for the Shadow Boxer Ks and [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]] for the Angels. Gude-Doge Machine has phenomenal stats here especially on 3-Crown difficulty, being able to one shot almost all meatshields. Because of this, you will need to rely on 4 or more meatshields to effectively stall them in place. Any attackers that can outrange Gude-Doge Machine such as [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] or certain Ubers will be helpful here so bring them. A difficult stage overall, but manageable with the right units.

